	* config/tc-microblaze.h (DWARF2_USE_FIXED_ADVANCE_PC): Define.
	* testsuite/gas/microblaze/dwarf2-fixed-advance.s: New file.
	* testsuite/gas/microblaze/dwarf2-fixed-advance.d: New test.
	* testsuite/gas/microblaze/dwarf2-fixed-advance.exp: New file.
	* testsuite/gas/elf/dwarf2-5.d: xfail microblaze.
